Number T(n,k,r) of partitions of an n X k X r rectangular cuboid into integer-sided cubes, considering only the list of parts; irregular triangle T(n,k,r), n >= k >= r >= 1 read by rows.

The 56 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A228202

